<title>UK: Cie Bancaire sets 750 million mark five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire sets 750 million mark five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Cie Bancaire</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    04.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    04.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.95     FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.95</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT/LUX   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.025     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
